{{also|Schreiben}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|schrīben|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|scrīban|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*skrībaną}}, a late borrowing from {{etyl|la|de}} {{term|scrībō||write|lang=la}}, which comes from a word meaning "to scribe, to scrape". Compare Low German {{term|schrieven|lang=nds}}, Dutch {{term|schrijven|lang=nl}}, English {{term|shrive|lang=en}}, West Frisian {{term|skriuwe|lang=fy}}, Danish {{term|skrive|lang=da}}, Swedish {{term|skriva|lang=sv}}, Icelandic {{term|skrifa|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃʁaɪ̯bən/|[ˈʃʁaɪ̯bən]|[-ʃʁaɪ̯bm̩]|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|schrei|ben|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-schreiben.ogg|Audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-schreiben.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-strong|class=1|schreibt|schrieb|geschrieben|past subjunctive=schriebe}}

